{"parse": {"title": "奠基石-考察", "pageid": 142065, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">奠基石</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">考察</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.86.8D.E4.BC.9A.E5.9C.A8.E6.96.B0.E4.B8.96.E7.95.8C\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"再会在新世界\">再会在新世界</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 再会在新世界</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">See You in the New World</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3882001</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"battle-info-group\" style=\"width: 305px;\"><div class=\"battle-info\"><div class=\"battle-info-title\">基本信息<span class=\"battle-info-subtitle\">INFORMATION</span></div><div class=\"battle-info-content\"><div style=\"width: 130px;\"><b>等级 /</b><img alt=\"洞悉Ⅲ\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Dongxi_da_003.png/30px-Dongxi_da_003.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"洞悉Ⅲ\" width=\"30\" height=\"25\" style=\"vertical-align: sub\" class=\"level-icon\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Dongxi_da_003.png/45px-Dongxi_da_003.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Dongxi_da_003.png/60px-Dongxi_da_003.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"76\" data-file-height=\"64\" />Lv.30</div><div style=\"width: 120px;\"