\"星\" width=\"16\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Star_liang.png/24px-Star_liang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Star_liang.png/32px-Star_liang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"68\" data-file-height=\"84\" /> 击败全部敌人<br /></div><div class=\"battle-info\"><div class=\"battle-info-title\">奖励<span class=\"battle-info-subtitle\">REWARD</span></div><div class=\"battle-info-empty\"><div><img alt=\"无奖励\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Bg_kong.png/200px-Bg_kong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"无奖励\" width=\"200\" height=\"52\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Bg_kong.png/300px-Bg_kong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Bg_kong.png/400px-Bg_kong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"454\" data-file-height=\"118\" /></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-info\"><div class=\"battle-info-title\">试用角色<span class=\"battle-info-subtitle\">TRIAL HEROS</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:bold; font-size:small\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3105\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BA%B8%E4%BF%A1%E5%9C%88%E5%84%BF\" title=\"纸信圈儿\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BA%B8%E4%BF%A1%E5%9C%88%E5%84%BF\" title=\"纸信圈儿\"><img alt=\"纸信圈儿\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-310501.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-310501.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-310501.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%BA%B8%E4%BF%A1%E5%9C%88%E5%84%BF\" title=\"纸信圈儿\">纸信圈儿</a></span></span>：<img alt=\"洞悉Ⅲ\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Dongxi_da_003.png/20px-Dongxi_da_003.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"洞悉Ⅲ\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" style=\"vertical-align: sub\" class=\"level-icon\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Dongxi_da_003.png/30px-Dongxi_da_003.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Dongxi_da_003.png/40px-Dongxi_da_003.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"76\" data-file-height=\"64\" />Lv.60 | 2级塑造</div><div style=\"font-size:small; text-align:right\">装配<span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1539\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A7%92%E9%92%88%E6%A0%96%E6%81%AF%E5%9C%B0\" title=\"秒针栖息地\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A7%92%E9%92%88%E6%A0%96%E6%81%AF%E5%9C%B0\" title=\"秒针栖息地\"><img alt=\"秒针栖息地\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ed/Equipment_icon-1539.png/100px-Equipment_icon-1539.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ed/Equipment_icon-1539.png/150px-Equipment_icon-1539.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/ed/Equipment_icon-1539.png/200px-Equipment_icon-1539.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"248\" data-file-height=\"248\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%A7%92%E9%92%88%E6%A0%96%E6%81%AF%E5%9C%B0\" title=\"秒针栖息地\">秒针栖息地</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"item-infobox\"><span>记忆者攻击时，如果处于吟诵中，本次攻击穿透率提升<span class=\"color-value\">14%</span>；记忆者额外行动时，暴击创伤提升<span class=\"color-value\">6%</span>，最多叠加3层，回合结束时移除1层</span></span></span></span></span>：Lv.60 | 5级增幅</div><div style=\"font-weight:bold; font-size:small\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3094\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/J\" title=\"J\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/J\" title=\"J\"><img alt=\"J\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-309401.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/5/56/HeadIconSmall-309401.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/J\" title=\"J\">J</a></span></span>：<img alt=\"洞悉Ⅲ\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Dongxi_da_003.png/20px-Dongxi_da_003.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"洞悉Ⅲ\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" style=\"vertical-align: sub\" class=\"level-icon\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Dongxi_da_003.png/30px-Dongxi_da_003.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Dongxi_da_003.png/40px-Dongxi_da_003.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"76\" data-file-height=\"64\" />Lv.60 | 2级塑造</div><div style=\"font-size:small; text-align:right\">装配<span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1531\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E8%AF%89%E4%B9%8B%E8%BD%BB\" title=\"不可诉之轻\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E8%AF%89%E4%B9%8B%E8%BD%BB\" title=\"不可诉之轻\"><img alt=\"不可诉之轻\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/Equipment_icon-1531.png/100px-Equipment_icon-1531.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/Equipment_icon-1531.png/150px-Equipment_icon-1531.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f6/Equipment_icon-1531.png/200px-Equipment_icon-1531.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"248\" data-file-height=\"248\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%B8%8D%E5%8F%AF%E8%AF%89%E4%B9%8B%E8%BD%BB\" title=\"不可诉之轻\">不可诉之轻</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"item-infobox\"><span>若记忆者处于<span class=\"tooltips color-sk\">[<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">燃烧</span>]<span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"buff-label\">状态异常</span> 受到治疗效果降低<span class=\"color-value\">15%</span>（效果不叠加)；回合结束时受到基于携带者攻击*<span class=\"color-value\">4%</span>的本源创伤（效果可叠加，最多可叠加<span class=\"color-value\">30</span>层，多层燃烧仅视为<span class=\"color-value\">1</span>个<span class=\"tooltips color-sk\">[状态异常]</span>，生效后扣除一半层数)</span></span>状态，攻击时术法威力提升<span class=\"color-value\">4%</span>；群体反击后，使自身攻击力提升<span class=\"color-value\">1%</span>，该效果最多叠加6层</span></span></span></span></span>：Lv.60 | 5级增幅</div><div style=\"font-weight:bold; font-size:small\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3146\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E7%91%9E%E5%AE%89%E4%BE%AC\" title=\"小瑞安侬\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E7%91%9E%E5%AE%89%E4%BE%AC\" title=\"小瑞安侬\"><img alt=\"小瑞安侬\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%B0%8F%E7%91%9E%E5%AE%89%E4%BE%AC\" title=